Rule 1 (input tensors must have compatible data types for Pow operation)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= (dtype_(x) = 6 ∨ dtype_(x) = 7 ∨ dtype_(x) = 8 ∨ dtype_(x) = 3 ∨ dtype_(x) = 4 ∨ dtype_(x) = 9 ∨ dtype_(x) = 10) ∧ (dtype_(y) = 6 ∨ dtype_(y) = 7 ∨ dtype_(y) = 8 ∨ dtype_(y) = 3 ∨ dtype_(y) = 4 ∨ dtype_(y) = 9 ∨ dtype_(y) = 10)
